{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"4a1e4470eb869a01e706ff4bf2b2f01c669d4c9a9689c6c377e77c725bb64909","ja":"アンバサダーになりたい！","zh":"我想成为大使！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"80b3e92da4037ad0bf676e83e0b761fc8082384c96e345645f0601e3e19ea4a0","ja":"ある日のお仕事終わり……","zh":"某天工作结束后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d034d168c2333af1048f7a0b3b897c8a515d555482ce4f5428a9324f42ae474e","ja":"やっぱり、\nハイブランドのアイテムっていいな～♪","zh":"果然，高端品牌的单品就是好啊～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2369c0c00c3ce0574e0144a57a20e72e5021a097bcf33468f86a45e258135246","ja":"お疲れ、真。あ、それ、この前買い物した時の写真？\nハイブランドのお店、ドキドキしたよな。","zh":"辛苦了，真。啊，那是之前买东西时拍的照片？\n去奢侈品牌店的时候，真让人心跳加速啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cd88a9b7a455bfc551c97604a69891a30bec78dbe51dd3a4f9ef6f684822e70f","ja":"……実はアタシ、せっかく買ってもらったのに、\nかざったままで、なかなか使えなくってさ～。","zh":"……其实人家虽然难得有人买给我，却一直摆着没用，怎么都舍不得用呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"666d3b428cca588ea834546094dc2a755b5075eb1121e7b2525eb80de5dae998","ja":"歩も？　実は、ボクもなんだ。\n使ってみたいんだけど、ちょっと怖いって言うか……。","zh":"步也？其实我也是。\n虽然想试试看，但怎么说呢……总觉得有点害怕。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"dc20db2506fe4b716e7aca22a40221eb78ed86fbaf5e6ed6e0c05619da06fdbe","ja":"わかる！\n汚しちゃったらどうしよう、とか考えちゃうよね。","zh":"我懂！\n会忍不住想，要是不小心弄脏了该怎么办呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"39446bf084b7060f2b30579a527e7dc604b9f85aca6c7cf03c366a78fe7b630f","ja":"そうそう！　こういうの、もっと気軽に……\nあ、●●●●プロデューサーからメールだ。","zh":"对对！这种事，就该更随意一点……啊，是●●●●制作人发来的邮件。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3514c14e288f07003a9d907e0441a6e292317b5330482a0950d3710e21c14058","ja":"なんだろう…………ええっ！？\nスカジのセカンドラインが立ち上がるんだって！","zh":"这是怎么回事…………诶！？  \n听说スカジ的副线要启动了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"162258ec5f95e4dba3f2e81599f91599c20bef230d79ed2355190076b3c96832","ja":"それで……ぜひ、ボクと朋花と歌織さんに\n説明会に参加してほしいって……！","zh":"所以……希望你务必和我、朋花以及歌织小姐一起参加说明会……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2eba66512b2828e70f1d790dc28b3dc879dca9b7543d7cb54f9b2473ba954468","ja":"えっ！　それって、\n3人がアンバサダーに選ばれた、ってこと！？","zh":"诶！也就是说，有3人被选为大使！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4dfd6743a8d6d9220c885909f3da8c395910319357bdf98e6c3eea3f383266a2","ja":"それはまだ、決まってないみたい。\n他にも候補者がいて、そこから選ばれるんだって。","zh":"好像还没决定。\n听说还有其他候选人，要从中选出一位。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"329662368af37d34fe2c4a348d87b62d4262ce8aa1bdcb8f3946c04cc281923d","ja":"オーディションみたいなのかな？","zh":"是不是类似试镜之类的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e7d23b0495d827f5b5a544660ab3dbaf614aebb3d02667210db60fc59711038e","ja":"セカンドラインって、ハイブランドを\nお手軽な値段にしたサブブランドだよね？","zh":"所谓副线品牌，就是把高端品牌做成价格亲民的子品牌，对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"130924d69c0d0bec75037fbd163f51333a830e7a1cbe63a832d1d84fb030dc44","ja":"うん、確か。……あ、スカジのHPに\n商品情報が載ってる……。","zh":"嗯，没错。……啊，斯卡吉的网站上有商品信息……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8e0390c6c67a30280893de2190875e09a35effc31a892ea0f6dffddf93a6ce8c","ja":"へぇ～……。なんかこの前お店で見たのより、\nもっとカワイイ系って感じ？","zh":"哦～……感觉比之前在店里看到的那种，更可爱一点？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a9efcecf8e6e3efae702d68d2632f05cb3120c6aff89506e2ea0c9884e5a11cf","ja":"お姫様寄りのイメージで\nデザインされてるんだって。わぁ～……。","zh":"据说是按照偏公主风的形象设计的。哇～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6c837e2c21cfaddb0dfab4f36b53006ddea622412661b8b1f5cb8eacbb03b85c","ja":"本当カワイイ……。気軽に使えそうな値段だし。\nボク、セカンドラインのアンバサダーになりたい！","zh":"真的好可爱……而且价格也很亲民，感觉可以轻松入手。\n我想成为副线品牌的形象大使！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"95031e9b0b8688aa10b3b05e2addbaac5c62fd11d7bfc512d040e9bf55a7916d","ja":"おおっ、やる気だな！\nアタシも応援するよ！","zh":"哦哦，很有干劲嘛！\n我也会给你加油的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1771.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"4e651652a1573d58a4daabf753c3599191f246bf6a142cc910859c303e81d26e","ja":"ありがとう！　そうと決まったら……\nさっそく戻って特訓だ～！","zh":"谢谢！既然决定了……\n这就回去特训吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
